Added [13 CLI tests](code_map/test/a5/one-question-one-answer.test.ts) and two fixture projects under `code_map/test/a5/`. One project models Effect services. Both fixtures type-check with zero diagnostics.

Every test name uses `A5 <name> — Fails if: "<line>"`, quoting A5’s full failure line:

> an answer comes only inside a dump or without its evidence or limits, or a whole map is produced unasked.

